collectathon-audio/ — Apache-2.0 (engine-authored originals)

All audio files in this directory are original works authored by the forgeax
engine project via procedural synthesis. They contain no third-party material
and are licensed under Apache-2.0, identical to the top-level forgeax-engine and
forgeax-engine-assets repositories.

No attribution is required. Commercial and noncommercial use, modification, and
redistribution (including inside a distributable runtime asset pack) are all
permitted under Apache-2.0.

See the repository-root forgeax-engine LICENSE for the full Apache-2.0 text.
